li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Mon travail consiste à enseigner.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · My job is teaching.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>J'ai une réunion le lundi.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · I have a meeting on Mondays.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Mes collègues sont sympas.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · My colleagues are nice.</span></li></ul>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":565000000}},{"id":"PtMWitwqCGMcHCu30RPo","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":3,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p03-b1","partTitle":"Say it 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Je travaille comme professeur.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">I work as a teacher.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Je travaille comme professeur.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":612000000}},{"id":"AV7jz1KchQdZrJfwZoTH","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":4,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p04-b1","partTitle":"Say it 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Mon travail consiste à enseigner.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">My job is teaching.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Mon travail consiste à enseigner.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":564000000}},{"id":"vitgtbFfrc9rQf33MZlv","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":5,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p05-b1","partTitle":"Say it 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>J'ai une réunion le lundi.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">I have a meeting on Mondays.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"J'ai une réunion le lundi.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":566000000}},{"id":"0jUFfH9QUn5kBZ8pVEa3","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Mes collègues sont sympas.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">My colleagues are nice.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Mes collègues sont sympas.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":980000000}},{"id":"K0TeoYhFIqQ37CgM8R0P","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Qu'est-ce que vous faites comme travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What is your job?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je travaille comme professeur dans une école.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I work as a teacher in a school.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>En quoi consiste votre travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What does your job involve?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je prépare des cours et j'enseigne aux élèves.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I prepare lessons and I teach students.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous commencez à quelle heure ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What time do you start?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je commence à sept heures et je finis à quinze heures.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I start at seven and finish at three.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous aimez votre travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Do you like your job?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Oui, parce que mes collègues sont sympas et les élèves sont motivés.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, because my colleagues are nice and the students are motivated.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276051,"_nanoseconds":998000000}},{"id":"TMA1tGITMqRRYJtRzIMc","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Qu'est-ce que vous faites comme travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What is your job?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je travaille comme professeur dans une école.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I work as a teacher in a school.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Je travaille comme professeur dans une école.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":15000000}},{"id":"gNjaHvAo0nQaY8hDwhu5","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>En quoi consiste votre travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What does your job involve?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je prépare des cours et j'enseigne aux élèves.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I prepare lessons and I teach students.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Je prépare des cours et j'enseigne aux élèves.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":42000000}},{"id":"IxIhCSkxeE365YNHZuHB","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":10,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p10-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Vous commencez à quelle heure ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What time do you start?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je commence à sept heures et je finis à quinze heures.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I start at seven and finish at three.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Je commence à sept heures et je finis à quinze heures.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":597000000}},{"id":"7aFqVrZJCtRYs2h4lmKS","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":11,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p11-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Vous aimez votre travail ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Do you like your job?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Oui, parce que mes collègues sont sympas et les élèves sont motivés.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, because my colleagues are nice and the students are motivated.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Oui, parce que mes collègues sont sympas et les élèves sont motivés.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":589000000}},{"id":"7mYkGEisxprwuaZj0e3o","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":12,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p12-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Parlez de votre travail.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">Talk about your work.</p><p><b>Describe your job, schedule and whether you like it.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “Je travaille comme professeur. Je commence à sept heures. J'aime mon travail parce que mes collègues sont sympas.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"Je travaille comme professeur. Je commence à sept heures. J'aime mon travail parce que mes collègues sont sympas.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":588000000}},{"id":"2J0VfizXDxyUZJNndWpB","level":"a2","lesson":14,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"a2-l14-p13-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">💼</div><p><b>Work talk, mastered!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can describe your job, your tasks and your schedule. A key topic in any social situation.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276052,"_nanoseconds":595000000}}]